{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7a/83djjatnymyg7u3t6jdmsub47rgc3vk.mp3","text":"这些工作嘉维尔是不会做的，部族里也没人想到要做，所以，我有空的时候会干一些。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b2/nxyulef8obak9gvtyg14gxuw6nwas6d.mp3","text":"医疗部缺实习护士的话，我可以去试试看，基础护理知识，我还是多少懂一点的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/39/3ukiq0ea17ty4ndmanv3vji15njp7hc.mp3","text":"博士，签字笔好像没墨了。啊，等下，请不要扔！如果您不介意的话，那个，能留给我吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/79/drt7d6npqc0d5sda6e8jcwbajgf3tjg.mp3","text":"罗德岛不能往下挖吗？地下没有宝物吗？珍贵的东西都锁在房间里？好可惜啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8c/p4r9otm1axq5w8wropvwrx3tnj93tap.mp3","text":"尾巴，又长了啊，再这样长下去，真的会被人嫌弃的啊，呜呜......好烦恼。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/ib3xwfjehwlwf1mxno47uyl5x5uio69.mp3","text":"尾巴大是天生的，强大又帅气是天生的，脑袋好也是天生的。既然没法选择出身，就怀抱着自己的独特生活下去吧。唔，当然博士您偶尔能帮帮我的话......是最好啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/7m29aqupd2k7lm72yktdaprlxnfnypn.mp3","text":"嘉维尔会旷工我是可以理解的，但她怎么会旷餐呢？是有什么东西让她困惑，害得她不得不躲起来吗？别人好像都没发现，能救她的只有我了！啊博士您在啊，能帮我一个忙吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/95/1oov56inws2zqcbga3dyo3mls67u82v.mp3","text":"您真的要看吗，背包里东西可能会有点多哦？好吧，我也好久没清点过了。唔，我们来看看：包裹着树叶的琥珀、一颗牙齿？一块带血黑结晶......一沓签名？！博士您不能再看了！到此为止！","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/38/tbb4rb2tage3s832bh9g92wkh1s5wc5.mp3","text":"能够引人直视，直到炽热的火焰烧干眼眶也不愿合上眼皮。嘉维尔她，大概就是这样闪耀的东西吧。哦对了，之前那段描述是我从书上看的，我觉得不错就背下来自己用了，还合适吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c3/tjvqouptbyoh3akh9m10nkl1pi35pfo.mp3","text":"捕梦网，就放这里吧，希望您有个干净舒适的好梦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:d/df/bnlkek55w8gfukq02uy0ge7lhqh6wc9.mp3","text":"您好，博士。呃我不是来捣乱的，我是，嗯，学习，对，来学习的。嘉维尔都过来了，我也不好一个人待在家乡，对吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/ghlaycdv3bnzeu0d33q6q2pde3l1sw2.mp3","text":"还，还是上战场直接操练一下比较好，对吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/4yg1f5a6e8xzxj788gqat9wkizt6h9r.mp3","text":"谢谢您送我这么好看的徽章，博士。嗯？唉，晋升奖章？啊，呃，呜呜......我，真的有资格拿吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/28hs0nv105padyj4pnkhov9395zi7f2.mp3","text":"我总有一天会配得上这面旗的，总有一天。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/j3lltalwj4beasq5fsmau8ambuh9kbf.mp3","text":"让我学学看您的技巧，要是真能学会就好了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/anix6nh9ga4n91wqp1o7zpynah3pvh6.mp3","text":"交给我吗，真的吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/q7kjbewj59j9f2lk2npmys1dpvcps2j.mp3","text":"走了，打，嗯，打爆他们。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5c/6sdzmnv3ubsgrxexaamwdnwdwe15pvh.mp3","text":"等一下，我还没准备好！","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/bjesslc1f0n2z9pu7hw0hnn5mymm6iu.mp3","text":"您没看见我，没看见我......","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c0/8efg7lr5v9uwe8msj4wtmmes1jx2ck2.mp3","text":"试试看？","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/kdvve5htc6q5yd58bsxuzlhbvk8hrki.mp3","text":"上，上了！","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/64/npl77ivyyz5aktuprmr6cggf9dgobl8.mp3","text":"需要挨打的家伙，都站出来！","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/nib5eczxiw5wgt88z51bcv6mgypoipl.mp3","text":"振作起来！","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/be/0wbo59ksm41s9mbpkmzaiv2ga73whes.mp3","text":"再撑一会，再撑一会！","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/76/itp0rj9dbs2t2kj5b6w27coocimn5d0.mp3","text":"哈！","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2b/ee2mcwjwlzux80uf4d8h1u2key20znd.mp3","text":"还有谁！","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:0/08/dt2y4f9fyr916hlfspih9z49z0ha18o.mp3","text":"以前博士您就是这么暴打我的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:4/49/nkufq7jgqdchv4hzh9w33ghyurpq01i.mp3","text":"赢了呢。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:1/18/ggee1q4p0auwfafyqpsjvzptw267xk1.mp3","text":"唔，背好酸，休息一下。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/nxdvf449kcur25y0jas5ss2jw6nk5vy.mp3","text":"我......对不起......","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/8zy7fyn5xhs0mpqubmc0e5bz1ginbjh.mp3","text":"啊啊，这个还不能丢，请给我吧，我自己来处理。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a8/pmptfzeweibqikoble6fd20pagjf1h6.mp3","text":"尾，尾巴......","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/18i7gz9t9h634y2hzmhwib2aaf78qis.mp3","text":"来尝尝萨尔贡土法烧烤好不好，我来烤，您吃就好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:3/32/9h8ftfynw8vcrty71kr2jb37osns2x1.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:5/55/no96r39tg3d9hz58x1u30445g5qwpmz.mp3","text":"放假的话，是不是就可以休息了？呼啊——嘉维尔在哪里啊，博士您见到她了吗？今天没有事情做，当然要和嘉维尔待在一起啦！","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/p8gw5dw0xr86ism2lovj3mvg4qmyu6d.mp3","text":"唔唔，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_411_tomimi/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/0ymuz2abuavid4dz9hjduzzy5rcnh6p.mp3","text":"这些工作嘉维尔是不会做的，部族里也没人想到要做，所以，我有空的时候会干一些。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:5/57/l53uak8nv2t9bxq5hahdrjdwucoh3k9.mp3","text":"医疗部缺实习护士的话，我可以去试试看，基础护理知识，我还是多少懂一点的。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/dakulihi0myu1t9awas5wzd538ul89o.mp3","text":"博士，签字笔好像没墨了。啊，等下，请不要扔！如果您不介意的话，那个，能留给我吗？","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/rv6ar1m1uusr8tq6f4z6atgts3ui9yx.mp3","text":"罗德岛不能往下挖吗？地下没有宝物吗？珍贵的东西都锁在房间里？好可惜啊......","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:2/21/jwctbmp6vv8o8yj7exl022xt9420q5l.mp3","text":"尾巴，又长了啊，再这样长下去，真的会被人嫌弃的啊，呜呜......好烦恼。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/73/9zlt6h9iffxm7yuc788najjl6ebw1rp.mp3","text":"尾巴大是天生的，强大又帅气是天生的，脑袋好也是天生的。既然没法选择出身，就怀抱着自己的独特生活下去吧。唔，当然博士您偶尔能帮帮我的话......是最好啦。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/3y5sgwdhh825woywa4kyee8i9lym5kt.mp3","text":"嘉维尔会旷工我是可以理解的，但她怎么会旷餐呢？是有什么东西让她困惑，害得她不得不躲起来吗？别人好像都没发现，能救她的只有我了！啊博士您在啊，能帮我一个忙吗？","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/lvemjnvr45hal0bzimmake8teqohc6i.mp3","text":"您真的要看吗，背包里东西可能会有点多哦？好吧，我也好久没清点过了。唔，我们来看看：包裹着树叶的琥珀、一颗牙齿？一块带血黑结晶......一沓签名？！博士您不能再看了！到此为止！","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/nnuxg01959t8npqbx3z9336itlpy47q.mp3","text":"能够引人直视，直到炽热的火焰烧干眼眶也不愿合上眼皮。嘉维尔她，大概就是这样闪耀的东西吧。哦对了，之前那段描述是我从书上看的，我觉得不错就背下来自己用了，还合适吧。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/85l4gl110jgdufp467yvxlagx3syg67.mp3","text":"捕梦网，就放这里吧，希望您有个干净舒适的好梦。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e6/h9nrwak6q0tln12wbx7llnqd03pjd48.mp3","text":"您好，博士。呃我不是来捣乱的，我是，嗯，学习，对，来学习的。嘉维尔都过来了，我也不好一个人待在家乡，对吧。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b5/8xl30y9fnd0qa534k9siq467zfsed57.mp3","text":"还，还是上战场直接操练一下比较好，对吧。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/3cerbqcmmull62ljsz3ofl83wdc4rhl.mp3","text":"谢谢您送我这么好看的徽章，博士。嗯？唉，晋升奖章？啊，呃，呜呜......我，真的有资格拿吗？","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/da/fkmsv9bdotj0xsz1kyws3acuwwj5860.mp3","text":"我总有一天会配得上这面旗的，总有一天。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5f/o5iwt9vs0qkyyw58p5nxg5nd6mraucb.mp3","text":"让我学学看您的技巧，要是真能学会就好了。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/oxz55wq2p61ze0xolldc9pc3908p8l1.mp3","text":"交给我吗，真的吗？","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/a6cy56ctkmjhxff1cncdk6r25v6x9lv.mp3","text":"走了，打，嗯，打爆他们。","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:2/23/o84it4lmrbcsnuyjqqdckkhkcyc4ph2.mp3","text":"等一下，我还没准备好！","alt":"voice/char_411_tomimi/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:3/35/joes5h0ifheyilh1l3f4am2lg